      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "5A53EBD7A9F6DDC2",
      "text": "Du schaffst das!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "5A53EAD7A9F6DC0F",
      "text": "Das nennt man Karma!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "E24687B6C79C3E54",
      "text": "Jaja... Aber das Problem is’ doch, dass ich\\nso gar keinen Bock auf Arbeit hab![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_04b",
      "hash64": "1A16D1952E7DB5C2",
      "text": "Woah, ich wusste gar nich’, dass du so ’ne scharfe\\nZunge haben kannst, [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0403,0000)]BroGirl![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
